{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41187","headline":"和许给事伤牛尚书 · 刘斌","name":"和许给事伤牛尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名臣不世出，百工之所求。\n况乃非常器，遭逢兴运秋。\n符彩照千里，铨衡综九流。\n经纶资百物，樽俎寄皇猷。\n韶濩倾复理，典礼紊还修。\n虽贞栋梁任，兼好艺文游。\n伫闻和鼎实，行当奉介丘。\n高衢翻税驾，阅水遽迁舟。\n传呼更何日，曳履闻无由。\n归魂藐修路，征櫂舣邗沟。\n林薄长风惨，江上寒云愁。\n夜台终不曙，遗芳徒自留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}